<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h2 data-lake-id="EVQuB" id="EVQuB"><span data-lake-id="ufb8c0a1d" id="ufb8c0a1d">功能描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uec5805ca" id="uec5805ca"><span data-lake-id="u31e4af58" id="u31e4af58">ProbeQueue 只把 L2 发来的 Snoop 发给 MainPipe。队列有 16 项。RXSNP 来时只要有空项就收下。满了就把 </span><code data-lake-id="ub031a85f" id="ub031a85f"><span data-lake-id="ub4ca56df" id="ub4ca56df">RXSNP.ready</span></code><span data-lake-id="ucb72eae3" id="ucb72eae3"> 拉低，不接受snoop，让L2保存好snoop。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9fc0029c" id="u9fc0029c"><span data-lake-id="u5f059033" id="u5f059033">一项的寿命很短。L2发来snoop的时候就申请，请求被 MainPipe 的 s0 收下之后就收回一项ProbeEntry。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub1eebae7" id="ub1eebae7"><span data-lake-id="u27b71bd5" id="u27b71bd5">同地址的 LR reservation 还有效时，这条 Snoop 留在队列里。不送给 MainPipe，也不释放。reservation 结束后再送。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9acf54b7" id="u9acf54b7"><span data-lake-id="ub6533d3d" id="ub6533d3d">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="YXtI5" id="YXtI5"><span data-lake-id="u5e203982" id="u5e203982">参数描述</span></h2><table data-lake-id="a2uv9" id="a2uv9" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 614px"><colgroup><col width="135"><col width="148"><col width="331"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u63129442" id="u63129442"><td data-lake-id="ueef46e00" id="ueef46e00"><p data-lake-id="ueeb1e077" id="ueeb1e077"><span data-lake-id="u0b2cad9c" id="u0b2cad9c">参数</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u04f0dd69" id="u04f0dd69"><p data-lake-id="u0341858b" id="u0341858b"><span data-lake-id="uf19e1a51" id="uf19e1a51">值</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9159b351" id="u9159b351"><p data-lake-id="u099156d6" id="u099156d6"><span data-lake-id="uadebf1f7" id="uadebf1f7">ProbeQueue 里怎么用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uba8e9bfe" id="uba8e9bfe"><td data-lake-id="ud076c414" id="ud076c414"><p data-lake-id="ubd364372" id="ubd364372"><span data-lake-id="ucce182a9" id="ucce182a9">nProbeEntries</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1759a2c4" id="u1759a2c4"><p data-lake-id="u0b433145" id="u0b433145"><span data-lake-id="u61c9672c" id="u61c9672c">16</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uaf4ea359" id="uaf4ea359"><p data-lake-id="u3b0ccf1b" id="u3b0ccf1b"><span data-lake-id="ude046fa7" id="ude046fa7">本地项号 0～15。这个号只用来对上交给 MainPipe 的那一拍，不是 CHI 的 TxnID</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u6959cf7b" id="u6959cf7b"><td data-lake-id="u1d0dbf07" id="u1d0dbf07"><p data-lake-id="u2446d2bd" id="u2446d2bd"><span data-lake-id="u33f540a4" id="u33f540a4">blockBytes</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucd1b4cf1" id="ucd1b4cf1"><p data-lake-id="u22d063f2" id="u22d063f2"><span data-lake-id="u68849924" id="u68849924">64</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4e24c9ca" id="u4e24c9ca"><p data-lake-id="uc5e97265" id="uc5e97265"><span data-lake-id="u45f0cd95" id="u45f0cd95">一项对应一整行。队列里不存 64B 数据</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u74ef3e9c" id="u74ef3e9c"><td data-lake-id="u14b5571f" id="u14b5571f"><p data-lake-id="u53300742" id="u53300742"><span data-lake-id="u50165859" id="u50165859">alias</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u443f8e81" id="u443f8e81"><p data-lake-id="uadd5053f" id="uadd5053f"><code data-lake-id="ua69b3772" id="ua69b3772"><span data-lake-id="uc1db856b" id="uc1db856b">vaddr[13:12]</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u74a244ec" id="u74a244ec"><p data-lake-id="u082339a2" id="u082339a2"><span data-lake-id="u2365316d" id="u2365316d">来自 RXSNP.tagAlias。物理地址恢复不了这两位交给 MainPipe 时必须带上，否则 VIPT 会查错 set</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u979b5a89" id="u979b5a89" style="height: 36px"><td data-lake-id="ube636a11" id="ube636a11"><p data-lake-id="u32294f35" id="u32294f35"><span data-lake-id="u2df4985a" id="u2df4985a">LRSCCycles</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf324da59" id="uf324da59"><p data-lake-id="ud32e8fe3" id="ud32e8fe3"><span data-lake-id="u0c3c4921" id="u0c3c4921">64</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua325a894" id="ua325a894"><p data-lake-id="u6722fc2a" id="u6722fc2a"><span data-lake-id="u9ddc7ed7" id="u9ddc7ed7">计数器大于 8 时，同地址 Snoop 留在这里</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="uc4324a9d" id="uc4324a9d"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="J2Ebc" id="J2Ebc"><span data-lake-id="u97f9630d" id="u97f9630d">接口描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub59899df" id="ub59899df"><span data-lake-id="u9dc2983d" id="u9dc2983d">方向按 ProbeQueue 自己看。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="jrsSg" id="jrsSg"><span data-lake-id="u5fff6738" id="u5fff6738">从 L2 收 Snoop</span></h3><table data-lake-id="pVF0k" id="pVF0k" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 619px"><colgroup><col width="99"><col width="71"><col width="123"><col width="326"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u59d21c27" id="u59d21c27"><td data-lake-id="ua43de01d" id="ua43de01d"><p data-lake-id="ua0b64e68" id="ua0b64e68"><span data-lake-id="u227d3f6f" id="u227d3f6f">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue941cc40" id="ue941cc40"><p data-lake-id="ub0067178" id="ub0067178"><span data-lake-id="u9456232e" id="u9456232e">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4114cf0c" id="u4114cf0c"><p data-lake-id="uf3a6a195" id="uf3a6a195"><span data-lake-id="u1bc68ed4" id="u1bc68ed4">信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u782f51b6" id="u782f51b6"><p data-lake-id="ua4f4cdd0" id="ua4f4cdd0"><span data-lake-id="uacaf8b2f" id="uacaf8b2f">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u62f5431c" id="u62f5431c"><td data-lake-id="uca6d9b65" id="uca6d9b65"><p data-lake-id="u3b1ab688" id="u3b1ab688"><span data-lake-id="u48aa15fe" id="u48aa15fe">RXSNP</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u621b511f" id="u621b511f"><p data-lake-id="u99bb7270" id="u99bb7270"><span data-lake-id="u9b232989" id="u9b232989">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud2113fcf" id="ud2113fcf"><p data-lake-id="u085defa0" id="u085defa0"><span data-lake-id="ud3fd1bba" id="ud3fd1bba">Decoupled</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u03c33831" id="u03c33831"><p data-lake-id="u951bba17" id="u951bba17"><span data-lake-id="u5c185b7d" id="u5c185b7d">边界上的这一条线只进本队列。</span><code data-lake-id="u74d8989e" id="u74d8989e"><span data-lake-id="u210a2b67" id="u210a2b67">ready</span></code><span data-lake-id="u2217fdfd" id="u2217fdfd"> 就是本队列的 </span><code data-lake-id="u34891dd8" id="u34891dd8"><span data-lake-id="ub09a9149" id="ub09a9149">ready</span></code></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u180252dd" id="u180252dd"><span data-lake-id="u8b9b017e" id="u8b9b017e">有空项时 </span><code data-lake-id="u38c55b4e" id="u38c55b4e"><span data-lake-id="u279e218a" id="u279e218a">ready=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="uc0792bc0" id="uc0792bc0">。16 项都占着时 </span><code data-lake-id="u1e4ff215" id="u1e4ff215"><span data-lake-id="u9c4eed31" id="u9c4eed31">ready=0</span></code><span data-lake-id="u6dec766f" id="u6dec766f">。如果本次不收snoop的话L2需要保存好字段信息。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua071e440" id="ua071e440"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="vIy6K" id="vIy6K"><span data-lake-id="ude4343b1" id="ude4343b1">交给 MainPipe</span></h3><table data-lake-id="CnG8G" id="CnG8G" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 680px"><colgroup><col width="151"><col width="87"><col width="122"><col width="320"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u7e2be23c" id="u7e2be23c"><td data-lake-id="uf3a9e280" id="uf3a9e280"><p data-lake-id="u12854012" id="u12854012"><span data-lake-id="uae7a8d67" id="uae7a8d67">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4b5446e1" id="u4b5446e1"><p data-lake-id="u0fd6852c" id="u0fd6852c"><span data-lake-id="ua3188971" id="ua3188971">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u78d2e3c1" id="u78d2e3c1"><p data-lake-id="u69564ea3" id="u69564ea3"><span data-lake-id="u05079bfa" id="u05079bfa">信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u752fbc02" id="u752fbc02"><p data-lake-id="uff7989e7" id="uff7989e7"><span data-lake-id="uc771d4a2" id="uc771d4a2">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u2235daa1" id="u2235daa1"><td data-lake-id="u6f9e415a" id="u6f9e415a"><p data-lake-id="u5b805600" id="u5b805600"><span data-lake-id="u24c1f32f" id="u24c1f32f">pipeReq</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u77ced710" id="u77ced710"><p data-lake-id="u29032973" id="u29032973"><span data-lake-id="u49536f7b" id="u49536f7b">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc77223d1" id="uc77223d1"><p data-lake-id="u0f25156f" id="u0f25156f"><span data-lake-id="ubbf7aeab" id="ubbf7aeab">Decoupled</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5014100a" id="u5014100a"><p data-lake-id="u61851c0a" id="u61851c0a"><span data-lake-id="u86120669" id="u86120669">这里的pipeReg是new的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u69bda9e1" id="u69bda9e1">MainPipeReq</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf9fe69d6" id="uf9fe69d6">，  带物理地址、还原出的 vaddr、opcode、needData、Snoop txnId、id</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub21c7e31" id="ub21c7e31"><td data-lake-id="u112ac926" id="u112ac926"><p data-lake-id="u27c96c86" id="u27c96c86"><span data-lake-id="u78d01990" id="u78d01990">lrscLockedBlock</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7e9d8465" id="u7e9d8465"><p data-lake-id="u81621b35" id="u81621b35"><span data-lake-id="u8842b8fe" id="u8842b8fe">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub97abe2f" id="ub97abe2f"><p data-lake-id="uac02d510" id="uac02d510"><span data-lake-id="u048e3f16" id="u048e3f16">Valid，地址</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubb92b4dd" id="ubb92b4dd"><p data-lake-id="u7f66578a" id="u7f66578a"><span data-lake-id="u0184dadd" id="u0184dadd">MainPipe 在 reservation 计数器大于 8 时拉高，不让probe</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4ef2fde2" id="u4ef2fde2"><td data-lake-id="ue5937757" id="ue5937757"><p data-lake-id="u8ed9c888" id="u8ed9c888"><span data-lake-id="u843ebd6d" id="u843ebd6d">updateResvSet</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u81de6826" id="u81de6826"><p data-lake-id="u472b33ff" id="u472b33ff"><span data-lake-id="u297afbc8" id="u297afbc8">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u12f78319" id="u12f78319"><p data-lake-id="u98429420" id="u98429420"><span data-lake-id="uab4dfd0e" id="uab4dfd0e">Bool</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7376dc1a" id="u7376dc1a"><p data-lake-id="u1ce6b584" id="u1ce6b584"><span data-lake-id="uebe88671" id="uebe88671">LR 刚写下 reservation 的那一拍。下一拍所有 Snoop 都再停一拍</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u48df6326" id="u48df6326"><span data-lake-id="u01bb2272" id="u01bb2272">为什么停一拍：LR写下reservation的那一拍，lrsc_addr还没进寄存器，下一拍才进寄存器，因此得打一拍然lrsc_addr进寄存器，后续才能进行比较看是否同地址。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="q3TIM" id="q3TIM"><span data-lake-id="u48cccf8a" id="u48cccf8a">事务描述</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id="z41C9" id="z41C9"><span data-lake-id="u98bd9d25" id="u98bd9d25">一条普通 Snoop</span></h3><ol list="u3d2ea1f2"><li fid="uc0d781fb" data-lake-id="u4473bb90" id="u4473bb90"><span data-lake-id="u18927011" id="u18927011">L2 把 RXSNP 放上总线。队列有空项，当拍收下，项从空闲进入待发送。</span></li><li fid="uc0d781fb" data-lake-id="ufe6e1900" id="ufe6e1900"><span data-lake-id="ud65d862e" id="ud65d862e">下一次内部仲裁选中它，再锁存一拍。这一拍是为了把“16 项里选一条”和“MainPipe 的 s0 仲裁”错开，不放在同一拍。</span></li><li fid="uc0d781fb" data-lake-id="u27f150ae" id="u27f150ae"><span data-lake-id="u9689168f" id="u9689168f">锁存之后 </span><code data-lake-id="uc62954bd" id="uc62954bd"><span data-lake-id="u5303e688" id="u5303e688">pipeReq.valid</span></code><span data-lake-id="uc09d4bc9" id="uc09d4bc9"> 拉高。MainPipe 的优先级是 </span><code data-lake-id="uf7b67c92" id="uf7b67c92"><span data-lake-id="ube817265" id="ube817265">probe &gt; refill &gt; store &gt; atomic</span></code><span data-lake-id="u5585989f" id="u5585989f">，所以只要 s0 没有被同 set 的 s1、s2、s3 冲突，就会收下。</span></li><li fid="uc0d781fb" data-lake-id="ube1bb2a3" id="ube1bb2a3"><span data-lake-id="u8977ce45" id="u8977ce45">收下的下一拍，这项释放。</span></li><li fid="uc0d781fb" data-lake-id="u60747cff" id="u60747cff"><span data-lake-id="uf0b65b01" id="uf0b65b01">后续写回脏数据等操作不在本模块中完成。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="u9674e2c8" id="u9674e2c8"><span data-lake-id="u274114b3" id="u274114b3">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="eIirZ" id="eIirZ"><span data-lake-id="u2863c4ea" id="u2863c4ea">reservation 挡住同地址 Snoop</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u3a90520f" id="u3a90520f"><span data-lake-id="u22ba8a6a" id="u22ba8a6a">MainPipe 只有一套 reservation。LR 成功后计数器从 63 往下减，大于 8 时有效。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u74672293" id="u74672293"><span data-lake-id="u700a71bd" id="u700a71bd">这段时间里：</span></p><ul list="u8ff83236"><li fid="u4beca8b0" data-lake-id="u1ed2f69d" id="u1ed2f69d"><span data-lake-id="u008df5dd" id="u008df5dd">同地址的 RXSNP 仍然收下，除非 16 项已经满了。</span></li><li fid="u4beca8b0" data-lake-id="u0d8997bb" id="u0d8997bb"><span data-lake-id="u0b87d02b" id="u0b87d02b">这项不参加发往 MainPipe 的发送，也不释放。</span></li><li fid="u4beca8b0" data-lake-id="u766d86d5" id="u766d86d5"><span data-lake-id="u3117693f" id="u3117693f">地址不同的 Snoop 照常发送。</span></li><li fid="u4beca8b0" data-lake-id="ud9ce363a" id="ud9ce363a"><span data-lake-id="u1ed6f9ef" id="u1ed6f9ef">LR 刚写下 reservation 的下一拍，所有 Snoop 都再停一拍。这一拍只做地址比较，避免比较和置位挤在同一拍。</span></li><li fid="u4beca8b0" data-lake-id="u2756211e" id="u2756211e"><span data-lake-id="u76e917c2" id="u76e917c2">计数器减到 8 或以下、SC 写成功、或者这行被写回并把 reservation 清掉之后，被挡住的那项再进入 MainPipe。进入后按普通 Snoop 处理，不把 SC 提前判失败。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u292b39dc" id="u292b39dc"><span data-lake-id="u225ec9b0" id="u225ec9b0">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="k3n1w" id="k3n1w"><span data-lake-id="u6d418fd2" id="u6d418fd2">队列满</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u87acf24d" id="u87acf24d"><span data-lake-id="ud67060a2" id="ud67060a2">16 项都不是空闲时，新的 RXSNP 停在线上。已经在队列里的项继续发送。不能为了收新 Snoop 把旧项丢掉，也不能覆盖一项还没交给 MainPipe 的请求。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1d860aae" id="u1d860aae"><span data-lake-id="ubb6db688" id="ubb6db688">reservation 挡住的项仍然算占用。它不释放，所以会占用容量。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue035238d" id="ue035238d"><span data-lake-id="ub2d69436" id="ub2d69436">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="DrU6i" id="DrU6i"><span data-lake-id="u577bd9a2" id="u577bd9a2">存储组织与数据结构</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u18563ad2" id="u18563ad2"><span data-lake-id="uc6d39f53" id="uc6d39f53">ProbeEntry一项里面带什么。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u22c42bb8" id="u22c42bb8"><span data-lake-id="u138b44d0" id="u138b44d0">16 项相同。一项里是寄存器：</span></p><table data-lake-id="YQXL8" id="YQXL8" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 718px"><colgroup><col width="103"><col width="69"><col width="229"><col width="317"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ue1d9608e" id="ue1d9608e"><td data-lake-id="u46c69d67" id="u46c69d67"><p data-lake-id="ud5c27ec0" id="ud5c27ec0" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u12679615" id="u12679615" class="lake-fontsize-11">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u91dbbe0b" id="u91dbbe0b"><p data-lake-id="uf90faf6e" id="uf90faf6e" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uc7503538" id="uc7503538" class="lake-fontsize-11">位宽</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uba80b59d" id="uba80b59d"><p data-lake-id="u49291a71" id="u49291a71" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u5ca69cb5" id="u5ca69cb5" class="lake-fontsize-11">何时写入</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue5ed110f" id="ue5ed110f"><p data-lake-id="ud0180549" id="ud0180549" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ube405d39" id="ube405d39" class="lake-fontsize-11">作用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u77893a7c" id="u77893a7c"><td data-lake-id="uff5fbe4c" id="uff5fbe4c"><p data-lake-id="ud93a7812" id="ud93a7812" class="lake-lineheight-15"><code data-lake-id="u2070d473" id="u2070d473"><span data-lake-id="uaa31cd48" id="uaa31cd48" class="lake-fontsize-11">state</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub0646925" id="ub0646925"><p data-lake-id="u8b8ee6fd" id="u8b8ee6fd"><span data-lake-id="uff8ac62d" id="uff8ac62d" class="lake-fontsize-11">2</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u47e2672a" id="u47e2672a"><p data-lake-id="u8638f01a" id="u8638f01a"><span data-lake-id="ua247e2da" id="ua247e2da" class="lake-fontsize-11">分配：空闲改为待发送。内部仲裁选中且没被 reservation 挡住，改为等MainPipe接受的状态</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4e04f27d" id="u4e04f27d"><span data-lake-id="u5ea0a53a" id="u5ea0a53a" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><span data-lake-id="u3fda19b6" id="u3fda19b6" class="lake-fontsize-11">被 s0 收下的下一拍：改回空闲</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud89976ee" id="ud89976ee"><p data-lake-id="ua20aaa0f" id="ua20aaa0f"><span data-lake-id="u0d1590c4" id="u0d1590c4" class="lake-fontsize-11">这项是空的、在等发送，还是已经交给出口、等 MainPipe 收下。reservation 不改它，只把发往 MainPipe 的 valid 压住</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u45a0d0fd" id="u45a0d0fd"><td data-lake-id="uad639aa8" id="uad639aa8"><p data-lake-id="ue13d09fa" id="ue13d09fa" class="lake-lineheight-15"><code data-lake-id="uc8ef2d6b" id="uc8ef2d6b"><span data-lake-id="u8c679cf1" id="u8c679cf1" class="lake-fontsize-11">addr</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucae92072" id="ucae92072"><p data-lake-id="u79d8fb49" id="u79d8fb49"><span data-lake-id="u04aed6ad" id="u04aed6ad" class="lake-fontsize-11">45</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucecf7983" id="ucecf7983"><p data-lake-id="uce503a66" id="uce503a66"><span data-lake-id="u6f3257f8" id="u6f3257f8" class="lake-fontsize-11">分配当拍，之后不改</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u01fe00d3" id="u01fe00d3"><p data-lake-id="u6aa30cd9" id="u6aa30cd9"><span data-lake-id="u289f36d1" id="u289f36d1" class="lake-fontsize-11">RXSNP 的行地址。和 reservation 比是不是同一行，也交给 MainPipe。低 3位不另存，送出时补 0，得到 64B 对齐的物理地址</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u6709d1dc" id="u6709d1dc"><td data-lake-id="u3c4123b1" id="u3c4123b1"><p data-lake-id="uf80ce560" id="uf80ce560" class="lake-lineheight-15"><code data-lake-id="u2db31d38" id="u2db31d38"><span data-lake-id="u96b672e8" id="u96b672e8" class="lake-fontsize-11">tagAlias</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u031e82d7" id="u031e82d7"><p data-lake-id="ue6589de2" id="ue6589de2"><span data-lake-id="u8a1b3c8e" id="u8a1b3c8e" class="lake-fontsize-11">2</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u23a8e4c1" id="u23a8e4c1"><p data-lake-id="u7c457bdf" id="u7c457bdf"><span data-lake-id="u2a662ef8" id="u2a662ef8" class="lake-fontsize-11">分配当拍，即 RXSNP.</span><code data-lake-id="uc50b07d1" id="uc50b07d1"><span data-lake-id="u27690a86" id="u27690a86" class="lake-fontsize-11">tagAlias</span></code></p><p data-lake-id="u09075f79" id="u09075f79"><span data-lake-id="u0fdacd26" id="u0fdacd26" class="lake-fontsize-11">，也就是这行进来时的</span><span data-lake-id="ue8380e35" id="ue8380e35" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><code data-lake-id="ue1081181" id="ue1081181"><span data-lake-id="u4bd51aaa" id="u4bd51aaa" class="lake-fontsize-11">vaddr[13:12]</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6bf1b400" id="u6bf1b400"><p data-lake-id="ude1dcaff" id="ude1dcaff"><span data-lake-id="u19a4328b" id="u19a4328b" class="lake-fontsize-11">和 </span><code data-lake-id="u8290d184" id="u8290d184"><span data-lake-id="u0b77fa8c" id="u0b77fa8c" class="lake-fontsize-11">addr[11:6]</span></code><span data-lake-id="u29998709" id="u29998709" class="lake-fontsize-11"> 拼出 </span><code data-lake-id="u46776d2c" id="u46776d2c"><span data-lake-id="u80e493d3" id="u80e493d3" class="lake-fontsize-11">vaddr[13:6]</span></code></p><p data-lake-id="u5f57c568" id="u5f57c568"><span data-lake-id="u7a41e327" id="u7a41e327" class="lake-fontsize-11">，MainPipe 靠它查 set</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uce6308af" id="uce6308af"><td data-lake-id="u9c9f8c9f" id="u9c9f8c9f"><p data-lake-id="u193a4276" id="u193a4276" class="lake-lineheight-15"><code data-lake-id="u07d701a1" id="u07d701a1"><span data-lake-id="u302e1a0d" id="u302e1a0d" class="lake-fontsize-11">opcode</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u42b39b85" id="u42b39b85"><p data-lake-id="u3c2f0fd4" id="u3c2f0fd4"><span data-lake-id="udaa6a691" id="udaa6a691" class="lake-fontsize-11">2</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub7581987" id="ub7581987"><p data-lake-id="u885b5952" id="u885b5952"><span data-lake-id="ucec71516" id="ucec71516" class="lake-fontsize-11">分配当拍</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u55e9977a" id="u55e9977a"><p data-lake-id="uf00cb8b7" id="uf00cb8b7"><span data-lake-id="ub40d1a15" id="ub40d1a15" class="lake-fontsize-11">失效、降为共享或清理脏责任。原样交给 MainPipe 的</span><span data-lake-id="udbb15389" id="udbb15389" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><code data-lake-id="u9655d822" id="u9655d822"><span data-lake-id="udfa5cb78" id="udfa5cb78" class="lake-fontsize-11">probeAction</span></code></p><p data-lake-id="u908a7be8" id="u908a7be8"><span data-lake-id="u63336d5b" id="u63336d5b" class="lake-fontsize-11">。编码还没冻结，队列不把它翻译成 SnpResp</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua8968b64" id="ua8968b64"><td data-lake-id="u80adaf6d" id="u80adaf6d"><p data-lake-id="u507bee71" id="u507bee71" class="lake-lineheight-15"><code data-lake-id="u96e4b3ea" id="u96e4b3ea"><span data-lake-id="udf6e69d3" id="udf6e69d3" class="lake-fontsize-11">needData</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2758dd74" id="u2758dd74"><p data-lake-id="u984cf05b" id="u984cf05b"><span data-lake-id="u726b81ec" id="u726b81ec" class="lake-fontsize-11">1</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8d469052" id="u8d469052"><p data-lake-id="u6b8c315d" id="u6b8c315d"><span data-lake-id="ucd89d617" id="ucd89d617" class="lake-fontsize-11">分配当拍</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u90a2087f" id="u90a2087f"><p data-lake-id="u5bc58548" id="u5bc58548"><span data-lake-id="u4092f76c" id="u4092f76c" class="lake-fontsize-11">对方是否要求带数据。MainPipe 和原来是不是 UD 一起决定 s3 交不交整行。项释放后 MainPipe 问不回队列，所以必须自己带走</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u06159b20" id="u06159b20"><td data-lake-id="u167ae63d" id="u167ae63d"><p data-lake-id="u0bd1d197" id="u0bd1d197" class="lake-lineheight-15"><code data-lake-id="ud091ad3c" id="ud091ad3c"><span data-lake-id="udfb4f1be" id="udfb4f1be" class="lake-fontsize-11">snpTxnId</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf1d09b3b" id="uf1d09b3b"><p data-lake-id="u31f17410" id="u31f17410"><span data-lake-id="u7cbf03df" id="u7cbf03df" class="lake-fontsize-11">8</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1ea009bb" id="u1ea009bb"><p data-lake-id="u94c5890b" id="u94c5890b"><span data-lake-id="u9003a4e0" id="u9003a4e0" class="lake-fontsize-11">分配当拍</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua3f651f8" id="ua3f651f8"><p data-lake-id="ub4188132" id="ub4188132"><span data-lake-id="u83733e52" id="u83733e52" class="lake-fontsize-11">L2 的 Snoop 编号。原样交给 MainPipe，再放进 WritebackQueue。SnpResp 或 SnpRespData 的 </span><code data-lake-id="u052edb1e" id="u052edb1e"><span data-lake-id="u19538106" id="u19538106" class="lake-fontsize-11">txnId</span></code><span data-lake-id="u39aa3e06" id="u39aa3e06" class="lake-fontsize-11">填它</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="uaac68e47" id="uaac68e47"><span data-lake-id="u699b24b8" id="u699b24b8">当前已经从 16 项里选出、准备给 MainPipe 的那条 </span><code data-lake-id="u00113c62" id="u00113c62"><span data-lake-id="ub4933071" id="ub4933071">pipeReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="u78263b84" id="u78263b84">需要锁存。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf359d7b7" id="uf359d7b7"><span data-lake-id="u9b973ca1" id="u9b973ca1">内部仲裁是编号小的优先。已经锁存的那条在 MainPipe 收下之前，下一条不能覆盖它。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf1e6890c" id="uf1e6890c"><span data-lake-id="ud4e95fb8" id="ud4e95fb8">空项的选择也是编号小的优先。同一拍只有一条 RXSNP，所以最多分配一项。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u48c0a523" id="u48c0a523"><span data-lake-id="u6b2ee270" id="u6b2ee270">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="qU8Jh" id="qU8Jh"><span data-lake-id="uaf6c917d" id="uaf6c917d">状态机行为</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5e77a264" id="u5e77a264"><span data-lake-id="ucf1f3148" id="ucf1f3148">ProbeQueue 不是 MainPipe 那种 s0 到 s3。下面是队列自己的拍。MainPipe 收下之后的 s1、s2、s3 见 </span><code data-lake-id="u51be92a4" id="u51be92a4"><span data-lake-id="u7301b726" id="u7301b726">MainPipe</span></code><span data-lake-id="u7da649a4" id="u7da649a4">。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="ZcKjj" id="ZcKjj"><span data-lake-id="u1da274cb" id="u1da274cb">分配当拍</span></h3><ul list="u24742ecc"><li fid="u799e1c98" data-lake-id="u904ccb90" id="u904ccb90"><code data-lake-id="ub7ae2327" id="ub7ae2327"><span data-lake-id="uaadf1d29" id="uaadf1d29">RXSNP.valid</span></code><span data-lake-id="u06d824e6" id="u06d824e6"> 且存在空项：写入编号最小的空项，状态变为待发送。</span></li><li fid="u799e1c98" data-lake-id="u1ae9c4b3" id="u1ae9c4b3"><span data-lake-id="u5a88bca4" id="u5a88bca4">这一拍还不向 MainPipe 发，先留一拍做状态转换。</span></li><li fid="u799e1c98" data-lake-id="u90a6225e" id="u90a6225e"><span data-lake-id="u001970b9" id="u001970b9">如果这一拍 LR 正在写 reservation，下一拍所有发送都停。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="Z7tjn" id="Z7tjn"><span data-lake-id="u7e6b2b9c" id="u7e6b2b9c">待发送</span></h3><ul list="ud2fb260a"><li fid="u409a5a63" data-lake-id="u90b169ac" id="u90b169ac"><span data-lake-id="u31030672" id="u31030672">没有被 reservation 挡住的项向内部仲裁请求。</span></li><li fid="u409a5a63" data-lake-id="u7b035db5" id="u7b035db5"><span data-lake-id="u441ab768" id="u441ab768">编号最小的项进入“已选中，等 MainPipe”。</span></li><li fid="u409a5a63" data-lake-id="u559c2a6b" id="u559c2a6b"><span data-lake-id="ucf65db61" id="ucf65db61">被挡住的项停在这里。地址继续和 </span><code data-lake-id="ua88c2632" id="ua88c2632"><span data-lake-id="u6a1e35a8" id="u6a1e35a8">lrscLockedBlock</span></code><span data-lake-id="u36a08ec5" id="u36a08ec5"> 比。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="p5Paj" id="p5Paj"><span data-lake-id="ud3008fa6" id="ud3008fa6">锁存一拍</span></h3><ul list="u245febfb"><li fid="u85f13a70" data-lake-id="u5f746b63" id="u5f746b63"><span data-lake-id="u6afbb2d0" id="u6afbb2d0">下一拍才把 </span><code data-lake-id="u711e95d8" id="u711e95d8"><span data-lake-id="u70adbdf1" id="u70adbdf1">pipeReq.valid</span></code><span data-lake-id="uea30750c" id="uea30750c"> 交给 MainPipe。</span></li><li fid="u85f13a70" data-lake-id="ucad37b9e" id="ucad37b9e"><span data-lake-id="u9e75e6fc" id="u9e75e6fc">reservation 若在这一拍变成同地址，出口的 valid 不变，寄存器里的请求保持不变。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="WSU34" id="WSU34"><span data-lake-id="u65469359" id="u65469359">交给 MainPipe</span></h3><ul list="u95830f3f"><li fid="u9cedba98" data-lake-id="ua096f33d" id="ua096f33d"><span data-lake-id="ue7165e62" id="ue7165e62">MainPipe s0 的 </span><code data-lake-id="u3b4a730c" id="u3b4a730c"><span data-lake-id="ubf88ecda" id="ubf88ecda">ready</span></code><span data-lake-id="ud1646035" id="ud1646035"> 为 1：本拍 fire。出口锁存在下一拍清掉，对应项也在下一拍变成空闲。</span></li><li fid="u9cedba98" data-lake-id="u57157e6d" id="u57157e6d"><code data-lake-id="u3b8fc327" id="u3b8fc327"><span data-lake-id="uf37c757f" id="uf37c757f">ready</span></code><span data-lake-id="uea417679" id="uea417679"> 为 0：valid 和全部 payload 保持。不能改地址，不能换一条 Snoop，也不能把这项释放后重用。</span></li><li fid="u9cedba98" data-lake-id="u0f70a250" id="u0f70a250"><span data-lake-id="u07aa4a76" id="u07aa4a76">fire 只说明 s0 收下。s3 还没改 Meta，WritebackQueue 也还没发应答。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="ALLlG" id="ALLlG"><span data-lake-id="uafdcc26f" id="uafdcc26f">同一拍各自在做什么</span></h3><table data-lake-id="cewl3" id="cewl3" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="375"><col width="375"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u14e9e386" id="u14e9e386"><td data-lake-id="u49ef6672" id="u49ef6672"><p data-lake-id="u40266c90" id="u40266c90"><span data-lake-id="u96cfde8f" id="u96cfde8f">位置</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u36dce945" id="u36dce945"><p data-lake-id="u8d90927f" id="u8d90927f"><span data-lake-id="uafe10986" id="uafe10986">这一拍可以做的事</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc7aeb62b" id="uc7aeb62b"><td data-lake-id="ua7735bc7" id="ua7735bc7"><p data-lake-id="u65f045a6" id="u65f045a6"><span data-lake-id="ue35b4f29" id="ue35b4f29">空项</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uca631a60" id="uca631a60"><p data-lake-id="uf97b569c" id="uf97b569c"><span data-lake-id="udc1a07d8" id="udc1a07d8">收一条新的 RXSNP</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u284283ec" id="u284283ec"><td data-lake-id="u5dcd3cdc" id="u5dcd3cdc"><p data-lake-id="u13250e31" id="u13250e31"><span data-lake-id="ub32c2e45" id="ub32c2e45">待发送的项</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc1bf7a43" id="uc1bf7a43"><p data-lake-id="u625488f3" id="u625488f3"><span data-lake-id="ub3dc36b0" id="ub3dc36b0">参加内部仲裁，或继续被 reservation 挡住</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="udc2f761f" id="udc2f761f"><td data-lake-id="u509ce36f" id="u509ce36f"><p data-lake-id="u1047d35d" id="u1047d35d"><span data-lake-id="u35b930ab" id="u35b930ab">出口锁存</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u72bf6bb1" id="u72bf6bb1"><p data-lake-id="uafd30b81" id="uafd30b81"><span data-lake-id="u67b23a8c" id="u67b23a8c">向 MainPipe 保持唯一的一条 </span><code data-lake-id="u162a3ba3" id="u162a3ba3"><span data-lake-id="u34549174" id="u34549174">pipeReq</span></code></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc3f08c2f" id="uc3f08c2f"><td data-lake-id="u566da31e" id="u566da31e"><p data-lake-id="ub7f527e0" id="ub7f527e0"><span data-lake-id="u5f395ea3" id="u5f395ea3">刚被 s0 收下的项</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8a45573b" id="u8a45573b"><p data-lake-id="u585fe678" id="u585fe678"><span data-lake-id="ud04582a4" id="ud04582a4">下一拍才释放。当拍不要分配给新的 RXSNP</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u03fb7189" id="u03fb7189"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u8d86fb82" id="u8d86fb82"><br></p>